  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The badger is a stocky, low-slung figure with a sphere head and an oval body, both worked in its signature grey-and-white pattern. Two black stripes run along the head from snout to crown using "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "colour-change"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "colour changes"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Start every piece with a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The badger sits about 12 cm long and 9 cm tall."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Materials"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "DK yarn: 50 g grey, 20 g white, 15 g black. 3.5 mm crochet hook. Pair of 9 mm "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "safety-eyes"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "safety eyes"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Polyester stuffing. Tapestry needle."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Gauge"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "24 sts × 28 rows = 10 × 10 cm in dc on a 3.5 mm hook."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Head"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work rounds 1 to 5 in white. On round 6, begin black "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "colour-change"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "colour changes"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " at the centre-front 8 stitches to form the two facial stripes. Continue the stripe pattern up to round 14, then switch back to grey for the crown."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1: 6 sc in magic ring (6 sts)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 2: [inc] × 6 (12 st) (12 sts)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 3: [2 sc, inc] × 6 (18 st) (18 sts)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 4: [3 sc, inc] × 6 (24 st) (24 sts)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 5: [4 sc, inc] × 6 (30 st) (30 sts)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 6: [5 sc, inc] × 6 (36 st) (36 sts)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 7: [6 sc, inc] × 6 (42 st) (42 sts)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 8: [7 sc, inc] × 6 (48 st) (48 sts)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
