      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work the body in grey with a white underside. Change to white for the lower third of the oval, creating a pale belly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1: Chain 9. Working along chain: 2 sc in 2nd ch from hook, sc in next 6 ch, 3 sc in last ch, rotate. Along opposite side: sc in next 6 ch, 2 sc in last ch (20 st) (20 sts)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 2: Increase 6 stitches evenly around (26 st) (26 sts)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
