            "type": "text",
            "text": " between rounds 9 and 10, 2.5 cm apart, above the white stripe. Stuff all pieces. Sew the head to one end of the body. Sew the legs short to the base so the badger sits low."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
