            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Embroider the nose in black using satin stitch over the white muzzle tip. Thread the needle with black yarn and carry it under the surface to start each stripe section without cutting. Weave in all ends. The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "amigurumi-decrease"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "invisible decrease"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " keeps the stripe edges clean where the colours meet."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Try the hedgehog next for a similar low shape, or make the mushroom as a quick extra piece."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
